window.products.push({"id":428106,"name":"gofeel Mattress Bag for Moving and Storage,Waterproof Dust-proof Heavy Duty Reusable Mattress Protector Bag with 8 Cross Handle（Twin）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w97CoZkgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cross Handle Design is More Solid: The traditional mattress carrying bag handles are all in-line design, and the force-supporting points of the in-line handle are only two, but our mattress carrying bag handle is a cross-shaped design with a cross-shaped handle There are three points of support. Therefore, the tarpaulin around the carrying handle is not easily torn, and can better bear the load. Easy to Carry and Protect the Mattress:Makes moving the mattress simple and easy and what a great product for someone who is about to move. Fit our queen mattress like a glove.Carry, drag and store your mattress without getting it dirty.It's designed to take the scuffs and scrapes so your mattress doesn't have to. Idle Mattress Storage Bags:The Mattress Bag is a great invention, it’s a good strong bag the handles and zipper make the task easier and protects the mattress from damage and if you have to store a mattress the bag is perfect for that keeping it dust free.Protecting them from dirt and pests. High-quality Thick Tarp Waterproof Material：The mattress moving cover is made of thick tarp material, which makes it more durable than standard plastic mattress bags. Ideal Gifts：If your family or friends are planning to move in the near future, I think this is a good gift to give.Please do mail us if you face any problems or not happy with the item, our team is always there for you to resolve any issues or do a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w97CoZkgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gofeel","source_asin":"B0B99SMMH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B99SMMH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B99SMMH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
