window.products.push({"id":428110,"name":"Baxton Studio Oreille Armchair, 27.3 x 25.35 x 40.56, Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":485.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dMqcy3rCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With its hand-carved motifs and resplendent wingback, the Oreille armchair revives a French-style stately charm. Fashioned from solid Mindi wood in oak finishing, no detail is spared on its majestic frame and statement. Neutral two-tone cotton-blend fabric with striped pattern and detailed piping upholster the chair throughout on the back and front. Place beside a fireplace, at a window, or in at the entryway for an old-world look and feel. One of the first things that stand out for the Oreille is its intricate detailing. Precision crafting along the armrest and legs as well as the piping details on the seat add a depth of character that tells a story and history behind the design. More than anything else the Oreille is built to be an accent armchair for comfortably seating of your family or guests. Ideal for sitting back after a long day and enjoying your private space or hosting visitor to your home. Made in Indonesia, the armchair arrives fully assembled.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dMqcy3rCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B018LGNLO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018LGNLO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018LGNLO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
