window.products.push({"id":428204,"name":"Humidifiers for Large Room Bedroom Living room,9L 2.38Gal Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier, Blowout fog,Customized Humidity,Remote Control, 28dBQuiet S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512CDebqTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【9L 2.38Gal Large Capacity & Powerful Blowout Mist Mode】 Covering up to 500 ft² of space, the humidifier’s 9-liter 2.38Gal water tank lasts up to 48 hours(2days) for fewer refills. Its Unique Technology of Powerful Blowout Mist Mode competitive 400ml/h mist output can cover your large bedroom, the humidifier will raise RH 15% in 20mins. Designed with a 360°rotating nozzle so that you can fully control the mist flow direction, enjoy the moisture from every corner at home. 【Intelligent Humidity Control】The Humidistat Sensor allows you to set your prefer humidity level from 40%-90%, which can automatically turn on or off based on the environment humidity.For example, if the product humidity is 50%. It will work, when the ambient humidity is below 50%. However ,when the ambient humidity is above 50%,it automatically stop working. So it can Maintain the room humidity at a healthy and constant level. 【Easy Operate &Remote Control 】The Modern Tower design can place your humidifier directly on the room ground,which can perfect Match other appliances in the home.You can refill water to the water tank or you Remove the top cover to add water directly.and there is a window level which can tell you how much you added. Easy clean because of the bigger opening tank， easy access to clean it with a wet cloth.You can operate the humidifiers by the digital display or operate with remote control. 【Sleep Mode& Timer &Essential oil box,the guarantee for Enjoy Your Life】The sleep mode ensure the sleep very quiet (≤ 28db) night while the humidifier is working, and will shut off the tank light. However, if you need, you can light the Tank Atmosphere Lamp .You can add 2-3 drops your favorite essential oil to the the aroma box on the top when you and your baby is sleeping.Enjoy wonderful, fresh-smelling air.You can set a 1-12Hours timer which prevent you to forgeting close it. 【Protection for Safeguard】 The humidifiers will light the No Water Indicator and auto shut off to protect you and the product, when there is no water in the water tank.Also, it can auto shut off when you and your baby lift the cover from the top or kick down the tank.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512CDebqTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Admettre","source_asin":"B0C5T5PQV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5T5PQV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5T5PQV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
