window.products.push({"id":428235,"name":"Baltique Montego Bay Collection 12-1/2\" Wooden Slotted Cooking Spoon, Safe for Nonstick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uEoW8K1vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CRAFTED WITH COLOR: This gorgeous slotted cooking spoon features a beautiful blend of teal, blue, gold, orange and red BEAUTIFUL AND FUNCTIONAL: A beautifully different slotted spoon that's ideal for both cooking and serving; it's sure to draw attention from guests HANDLE ANY COOKING TASK: At 12-1/2 inches long, this slotted mixing spoon can reach even the deepest of cooking pots; safe for use on nonstick coatings A TROPICAL TRIP IN YOUR KITCHEN: Our Montego Bay Collection takes inspiration from the relaxing sunsets on the shores of the Jamaican vacation destination EASY CARE: Simply hand wash or wipe with a damp cloth; do not soak in water or wash in the dishwasher","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uEoW8K1vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B0B8338Z93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8338Z93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8338Z93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428236,"name":"Butter Dish with Lid and Knife,Airtight Butter Container Covered Butter Dish for Countertop or Fridge,ABS Plastic Butter Dishes with an Attached Flip-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPYEs9nrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fashion Design ：This is the only butter dish with an attached flip-top lid. By attaching the lid to the base, the lid never touches your butter or your counter. With this simple design improvement, BURUIJI solves the slippery mess a traditional 2-piece butter dish makes. Product Size ：This large size butter keeper (L6.73*W3.46*H2.28 inch) , wide and deep enough for holding East and West Coast / European butter, the interior is spacious enough that the butter does not touch the top and the edge of the lid. The butter container also doesn't take up too much space, keeping your kitchen tidy and organized. Environmentally and Safe Materials：BURUIJI butter container is made with a high-quality, sturdy, shatterproof, food-safe, BPA-free plastic. If you prefer to keep your Butterie in the refrigerator, it will perform better than any glass or ceramic butter dish since the lid will not fuse together when the butter becomes firm. Butter Dish with Knife: This butter dish with lid is designed with a knife within the lid, so you can take the included knife from the lid for spreading or cutting at your convenience, This butter dish is a blend of morden and simplicity, it can match any kitchen style, making it perfect as a countertop decoration . Easy to Store and Clean: This is a multifunctional butter container, you can also use it to store other things such as biscuits, nuts, seasonings, etc. Easy to Clean,Simply hand-wash,Cannot be cleaned with a dishwasher！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPYEs9nrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BuRuiJi","source_asin":"B0B8BXV4ST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8BXV4ST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8BXV4ST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
