window.products.push({"id":428247,"name":"AMERICA EMPORIUM Hotel Like Quality Egyptian Cotton Made in USA Sheet Set 800 TC Fits Up to 15 Inches Deep Pocket Solid (Queen, SkyBlue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UFUy61QxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHEER LUXURY: FEEL THE RICHNESS OF 100% COTTON in your bed. The material we used is one of Premium luxury GRAB THIS SET NOW and experience your slumber like never before. EXCELLENT CRAFTSMANSHIP: Closely woven and crafted with best techniques our products offer an exciting range of cotton in many fabrics and vibrant colors. Keeping the perception of customers in my mind - an outstanding finish is given to each of our products, which gives them STRENGTH AND UNIQUENESS of their own. BEST PURCHASE YOU’D EVER MAKE: You are Buying a AMERICA EMPORIUM sheet set which is made from the super fine quality of Egyptian cotton and is considered as one of the best, CHEMICAL-FREE, NATURAL AND ECO-FRIENDLY cotton in the world. EGYPTIAN COTTON is a well-renowned bedding fabric and is distinctive for COOLING COMFORT, ITS STRENGTH AND SOFTNESS. Which makes it strongest amongst other fabrics and gives a safe and peaceful sleep to you. NO SLIPPING: AMERICA EMPORIUM'S Fitted sheet will not only fit the deep mattresses, but also it is oversized in length and width to accommodate any topping mattresses you might have. And it is to keep it from slipping off the mattress while the bed in use. WASH CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Machine washable on a delicate cycle with cold water. Use only mild detergents. Tumble dry, delicate, on low heat until completely dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UFUy61QxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICA EMPORIUM","source_asin":"B07K27RFVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K27RFVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K27RFVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428248,"name":"Briel ES200APG Multi-Pro Stainless Pump Espresso with Auto Espresso Flow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51344B4HQ3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Briel Multi Pro Prestige Espresso/Cappuccino Machine! This highly-polished, stainless-steel thermo block unit comes with the pressure gauge and superior control of espresso quality that's found elsewhere in commercial machines. For use with fresh ground Amazon.com Not for the novice espresso drinker or for the Starbucks-style café latte fan, this professional espresso machine is the workhorse type found in small cafes throughout Europe. Think single-shots of thick espresso and small cups of cappuccino, as anything else is beyond the realm of this machine. Briel is Europe's largest manufacturer of pump-driven espresso machines, and its Multi-Pro series is designed to be used with fresh ground coffee or ESE coffee pods, which are small portions of ground coffee pressed between two pieces of food-compatible paper. Coffee pods are packed with the right weight, roast, and grind, so even the inexperienced barista can consistently make great espresso. This machine features Auto Espresso Flow, an adjustable electric timing control that lets you select serving size in advance. One of two filter holders brews two cups of espresso at a time. Other bright spots include the Turbo Jet frother, equipped with a steam control knob and removable cappuccino nozzle; a self-priming pump fed by filtered suction and water return tubes; a cup warmer; a removable drip tray and grid; and a coffee tamper. The removable 2.5-liter water tank also has a water level indicator viewable from the front of the machine. One downside is that the brew head fits so tightly into the filter holder that it strictly limits the amount of coffee that can be loaded into it, which complicates the brewing process when using fresh ground coffee. --Matthew Evans Editor's note: This item may arrive with water inside from the manufacturer's pressure test. This is a normal occurrence and doesn't point to a problem with the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51344B4HQ3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Briel","source_asin":"B00004RHMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RHMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RHMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
