window.products.push({"id":428294,"name":"Paperproducts Designs\"Vineyard Sheep by Vicki Sawyer\" Paper Cocktail/Beverage Napkins, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bk09-1W+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"High quality cocktail napkins from PPD Paper product Designs feature witty contemporary phrases and graphics on the highest quality 3 ply napkins. Each package contains 20 5\"x5\" napkins that are printed with non-toxic water soluble inks. In addition, our napkins are all compostable. We carry over 1,000 different items in our line with many coordinating products in paper and ceramic. Check out our entire line of clever and fashion forward designs to maximize the fun at your next event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bk09-1W+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paperproducts Design","source_asin":"B01FZ0VABM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FZ0VABM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FZ0VABM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428295,"name":"3 Gallon Equivalent Air Pot Pruning Plant Container 100% Hdpe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n9SW5lEvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Free shipping to 48 continental US states (not include HI, AK, PR etc)  Super fast shipping from USA !  What's in the box:  1pcs x Side Wall (L 29.5\"* H 11.8\" / L75cm*H30cm)  1pcs x Circle Base Plate (Diameter : 7.8\"/20cm)  4pcs x Plastic Screw   Feature:  The Air-Pot is smartly designed pot . Air pots allow plant roots to grow outwards, instead of spiraling round themselves inside the pot. The inwards pointing cone deflects roots outwards. When the roots near the hole of the outwards pointing cones, the tips of the roots dry out because there is too much air density. And, because the plant's lateral roots will have been allowed to grow more naturally and vigorously, transplantation is much more successful. The small size is ideal for potting on young seedlings. Larger sizes make excellent containers for growing vegetables, too. Also used widely in hydroponic gardening. Made from 100% recycled HDPE, The pot can be re-used for many seasons.  Work Principle:  Roots bounce off of the inwards pointing cones and grow outwards, towards the holes of the outwards pointing cones. When they reach the holes, the tips of the roots dry out. This air-pruning initiates a response in the plant to grow more roots. This process repeats itself all the time the plant is in the pot, and it develops a remarkable radial root system. No other container can help a plant develop in this way.  Main Features:  Improved root development  Increases resistance to disease.  Improved oxygenation  Improved nutrient uptake  Improved plant quality  100% HDPE plastic  Reduced transplant shock  Faster growth rates  Higher yields  Be used with a wide range of organic or hydroponic media  Longer pot life","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n9SW5lEvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trustlight","source_asin":"B00NZ575Z0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NZ575Z0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NZ575Z0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
