window.products.push({"id":428310,"name":"10 PCS Bohemian Style Tile Sticker Peel and Stick, 6x6 Inch Decorative Stickers, Tile Waterproof Oil Proof Tile Decals for Bathroom & Kitchen Backspla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YSL-Uc0CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Best Material: We use high-quality thick PVC material, with crystal film on the surface of the tile sticker and with high gloss. Product features: 1. Waterproof, oil-proof, light-proof, no need to worry about water stains, oil stains, and no need to worry about the color of original floor tiles and wall tiles. 2.Easy to remove the stains, just need to wipe the surface with water or cloth. 3. Scratch resistance, strong adhesion, no residue will be left whether it is peeled off the wall or the floor. Applicable scene: For decoration, it can be attached to the kitchen, bathroom, backsplash, bedroom, living room, stairs, floor etc. It is not limited to every flat and clean surface in the home, and it is suitable for any place you need. How to use: Peel it off and stick it on a clean, smooth and dry surface. The sticker can be easily cut into any shape, and installation does not require any special tools, just scissors. Our sticker designs are diverse and easy to cut. You can freely and easily DIY anytime and redecorate your space according to your own preferences. Size and quantity: One sticker is about 6×6 inches (about 15×15 cm), and the package is a set of 10 sheets, all with exquisite high-definition patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YSL-Uc0CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOSYCO","source_asin":"B099ZFQ21D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZFQ21D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZFQ21D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428311,"name":"JTX Leather Round Placemats & Coasters Set of 4, Coffee Mats Placemats for Dining Table, Heat- Resistant & Stain Non-Slip Waterproof Easy to Clean for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XoSHVgjIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿MATERIAL: Our placemats are made of eco-friend leather materials. Heat insulation, non-slip, wear resistant. The exquisite table mats not only effectively protect your dinner table from scratches, heat and stains, and also extend the life of your table. ✿DESIGN: Round design match all kinds of tables. Two sides with different texture can be used. Various colors for you to choose. Reasonable size for daily use. We are thoughtful to match a set of independently packaged coasters, which you can use for your own or give away. ✿EASY TO CARE: The leather placemats are washable and easy to clean up, wipe or rinse clean and use a soft brush when necessary. No machine wash. No microwave. Easily stored, roll up to store it away, flatten when put out to use. ✿MULTIPLE USES: Suitable for both indoor and outdoor, such as home kitchen, dessert house, cafe club, izakaya, business offices, BBQ, party, wedding and more. A great gift for Mother’s day, housewarming, your friends and Christmas etc. ✿PACKAGE: Placemats set of 4 + Coasters set of 4; Placemats Size in :13\" x 13.\" (33cm x 33cm), Please don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions about the placemats, we will reply you within 24 hours or ASAP. Thanks!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XoSHVgjIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JTX","source_asin":"B08GC75KBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GC75KBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GC75KBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428312,"name":"Erbulus Turkish Glass Blue Evil Eye Wall Hanging Sufi Whirling Ornament - Metal Home Decor – Turkish Nazar Bead Amulet - Protection and Good Luck Char","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Uun6LzsuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Turkish evil eye beads are made in furnaces called \"quarry\". Quarry pine wood is used to provide high energy in the quarries. Waste glass and coloring materials are placed in special compartments located inside the quarry and it is turned on. As the temperature of the quarry reaches a temperature of about 1000 ° C, waste glass and coloring matter melts and masters begin to produce. Blue, white, yellow, green, purple, brown and red colors are used in the production of evil eye beads. During the production, various tools are used which are sindirgısıdır iron, merdan, asaba, rail iron, steel bar, merteke and mold. Bead mastering, which has reached today by transferring the skills in master-apprentice relationship, is a traditional profession. In Turkey, it is known by the name nazar boncugu and known by the name ojo turco in Spain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Uun6LzsuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erbulus","source_asin":"B077N6MKC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077N6MKC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077N6MKC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
