window.products.push({"id":428384,"name":"Zavahome Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - Mill Pair - Glass Body - Ceramic Rotor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Aks5v4haL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Master Chef's Favorite Tool for Freshly Ground Peppers, Salts, and More! Elegant and stylish, this high-quality, stainless steel salt and pepper grinder set will be a wonderful addition to your kitchen for years to come. ELEGANT HIGH-QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: With a glass body and stainless steel top exterior, these pepper and salt mills will look amazing on your counter and withstand the test of time! SAVES YOU MONEY: Forget wasting money on cheap, disposable grocery store grinders! Spend only on what matters...freshly ground spices and salts! ADJUSTABLE COARSENESS SETTINGS: From fine to coarse, these strong, non-corrosive ceramic grinders NO BATTERIES REQUIRED: These simple-to-use manual grinders are easy to operate! EASY TO REFILL: With a unique top-loading design, quickly screw off the top and refill in seconds with your favorite salts or spices. GENEROUS CAPACITY: 5\" tall and 2.5\" wide, these classy grinders have a 3/4 cup capacity CLEAN TABLE GUARANTEED: With the cap and grinding mechanism on top, you'll keep your tables and counters clean! Keep your freshly ground spices where they belong...on your food! (*Spices not included in your purchase) Quality manufacturing and unmatched customer service make Zavahome the best choice for professional and amateur chefs alike. Their elegant products feature comfortable and innovative designs guaranteed to make your cooking and entertaining more enjoyable. Rest easy, because this set is warranted against any defects. You are fully protected by the Zavahome Ironclad Lifetime Guarantee! Taste the Zavahome difference with freshly ground spices! Take your kitchen tools to the next level by clicking on the \"Add to Cart\" button now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Aks5v4haL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zavahome","source_asin":"B016AR2HZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016AR2HZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016AR2HZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428385,"name":"Huddleson Silver Grey Italian Linen Tablecloth, 80x122 Oval Luxury Made in US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":310.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XI3wlM2bL._AC_.jpg","description":"100% PURE ITALIAN LINEN, which is extremely durable and resilient, many times stronger than cotton. Linen fabric is woven from the stems of the flax plant, whose unique structure is why linen is both supple and resistant without pilling or becoming distorted. To create our linen fabric requires minimal processing and no chemicals. Year after year, wash after wash, the fibers do not stretch out of shape, break or pill, while at the same time becoming softer and more beautiful. MADE IN USA. Huddleson is the leading independent manufacturer of contemporary fine table and bed linens, based in Los Angeles. We source our European linen from the premier linen mills in Northern Italy and cut and sew the finished products in California, USA. Huddleson linens have been featured by many of the top design magazines and blogs including Traditional Home, House Beautiful, Robb Report, Food & Wine, Real Simple, Lonny, Remodelista and lots more. MACHINE WASHABLE. Linen fabric cleans very well in the washing machine. If your linen tablecloth or table linens pick up marks or stains, soak overnight in a stain remover like OxiClean and then machine wash. VIBRANT, LUXURIOUS, CLASSIC linen has a texture, feel and drape that has been admired for thousands of years, because it is elegant, lustrous and comforting. Linen represents simple, classic, sophisticated good taste. Also, because of linen?s highly absorbent nature, it holds dye very deeply for a saturated, rich color that fades minimally. BEAUTIFUL SILVER GREY LINEN TABLECLOTH Modern neutral color offers a fresh, unexpected, alternative to Ivory or White and will highlight any metallic accents on the table. A great foundation for the perfect 21st century place setting. Size: 80\"x122\" Oval Sewn with a 0.5\" Hem - fits perfectly on Knoll Saarinen Tulip dining tables. One piece - no seams.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XI3wlM2bL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huddleson","source_asin":"B07F9HPFHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F9HPFHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F9HPFHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
