window.products.push({"id":428456,"name":"Root Candles Honeycomb Beeswax Blend Scented Candle, 12-Ounce, Bourbon Pear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TD3TQa7LS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"USA-made glass candle made with Root's proprietary blend of beeswax and other premium natural waxes. Fragranced with pure essential oils, this 12-ounce size fills your home with up to 50 hours of welcoming fragrance. Made with an all natural cotton (lead free) wicks for a cleaner burn. Root Candles is an iconic American company that traces its lineage back to 1869 when founder Amos Ives Root first opened his doors for business in Medina, Ohio. Since then, 5 generations of Root candle-makers have created the best candles in America. Using all-natural materials for purity and balance, Root candles seduce your senses, enhance your living space and soothe your soul. Candles are manufactured according to all ASTM (safety) standards. Root manufactures their own all-natural cotton wicks and test burns 1, 000 candles every day to check fragrance throw, emissions, soot, flame strength, stability, useful life, welling, dripping, and burn time. Stringent color matching is done daily to ensure consistent quality from batch to batch. Root has combined the time honored methods of early 20th century hand crafted candle-making, with 21st century automation technologies to continue a renowned tradition and reputation. Every Root candle is made in the USA, on the same plot of land Amos Ives Root, purchased over 100 years ago. The results are pure and simple: Root candles are highly regarded for complex bouquets of subtle fragrances and sophisticated color palettes. Today, Root candles continues traditional standards of superior candle craftsmanship while introducing vibrant new textures, brilliant new colors, complex and intriguing new fragrances, and innovative, modern designs to their collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TD3TQa7LS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Root Candles","source_asin":"B0923PXYVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0923PXYVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0923PXYVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428457,"name":"Red Co. Set of 6 Enamelware Metal Small Classic 5 Oz Round Coffee and Tea Mug with Handle, Solid White/Red Rim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614nObRhvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A classic mug with a smooth, enameled white surface and red rim to complement vintage, shabby chic, antique, cottage, farmhouse, and country living décor. Ideal for everyday use with hot or cold beverages—just pour in your favorite drink, such as coffee, tea, hot cocoa, milk, juice, soup, and so much more. These mugs feature a wide mouth and comfortable handle. Lightweight, shatterproof, and easy to clean, it’s perfect for camping, BBQ, picnics and outdoor activities. Made from the highest quality enameled metal, it is food, oven, freezer, and dishwasher safe (but not microwave safe). Dimensions: 2.25” tall with a 2.5” diameter; Capacity: 5 fl. oz (150 ml or 0.6 cups). Comes as a 6-piece set. Wash before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614nObRhvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Co.","source_asin":"B0C69XYH7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69XYH7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69XYH7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428458,"name":"Home Beer Brewing Equipment Kit with Traditional Wheat Beer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IWU5oV13L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With The Home Brewery Equipment Kit and Ingredient Kit brewing beer at home is not only fun, but easy too. This starter kit comes complete with our special recipe for Traditional Wheat Beer. Wheat beers are a very popular in America as well as Europe. They are known for their hearty flavor, light gold color and creamy white head. We use German hops and a blend of wheat and barley malt extract to create this refreshing ale. This kit includes all the ingredients necessary for your first 5 gallon (2 cases) batch of homebrew. Our special recipe ingredient kits are totally complete and include: all the malt extract needed for the recipe (no need to add sugar here), specialty grains for added flavor and a cheesecloth bag for steeping them, Fresh hops for just the right amount of bitterness, flavor and aroma, yeast, clarifier, priming sugar for bottling and full instructions specific to each recipe. Our equipment kit sets you up with all the special equipment you need to make outstanding homebrew again and again. It is versitile and easily expandable to grow with you and your interests. Kit includes: 6.5 gallon fermenting bucket with lid, stopper and airlock, 6.5 gallon bottling bucket, bottle filler, bottle capper, 144 caps, 5 ft siphon hose, 24 in siphon cane with anti-sediment tip, hydrometer, thermometer, sanitizer and an instruction book. The only extra items you will need are a stock pot to boil in (we suggest at least a 3-5 gallon size) and beer bottles that are either pry-off (not twist off) or flip-top to bottle in. This hobby is easier than you think! Give it a try and you wont be disappointed. Questions? Don't hesitate to give us a call for guidance and advice. You can count on The Home Brewery for unbeatable service, even after the sale.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IWU5oV13L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Home Brewery","source_asin":"B0006LZ5X0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006LZ5X0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006LZ5X0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
