window.products.push({"id":428494,"name":"StyleChic Cotton Muslin Throw Blanket with Buffalo Check Pattern, Vintage Indoor and Outdoor Use, Reversible and Breathable Fabric for Yard Picnics, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aQuwH8soL._AC_.jpg","description":"Decorate Your Home or Enjoy a Quick Picnic with a Stylish and Versatile Throw Blanket from StyleChic A blanket has so many important uses around your home. You use it for adding color and depth to your bedroom decor, wrap up in it to watch your favorite shows on TV, and even take it with you to enjoy a nice day at park with your kids. That’s why we created an all-purpose cotton throw blanket that’s soft, stylish, and versatile so you can use it in a multitude of exciting ways. Woven with 100% yard-dyed cotton double layer gauze fabric, our breathable and durable blanket is lightweight enough to take to your picnic but warm enough to keep ready for reading on your favorite chair. Thin, Lightweight Fabric We use a strong, high-quality yarn in our buffalo check throw to give it just the right balance of comfort, style, and portability so you can use it at home or on the go. Vintage Buffalo Plaid Design A more traditional “old fashioned” look perfect for those with a bohemian or farmhouse style our warm throw blankets provide the perfect ground cover for a quick picnic at the park and look great dressing up a bedroom chair or living room space. Multiple Sizes Available We offer our muslin cotton throw blankets in a 90” x 94” queen size, 104” x 94” king size, and a more travel-friendly 47” x 60” so you can stay warm and stylish anywhere. Machine Wash Safe These buffalo check blankets can be washed on a cold cycle in the washing machine and then tumble dried on low to give it a crisp, clean feel. No bleach or ironing necessary. Natural Yarn-Dyed Fabric This indoor and outdoor safe throw blanket meets strict OekoTex 100 certifications.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aQuwH8soL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StyleChic","source_asin":"B08GX7W785","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GX7W785","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GX7W785","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
