window.products.push({"id":428618,"name":"Beclecor Waterproof Mattress Encasement Box Spring Zippered Protector 6 Sided Cover Breathable Cotton Terry Surface Fitted up to 13\"-Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s+l1w5v0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Beclecor brand is focused on home textiles to create a more comfortable family life for you. Solving your needs is our goal! Why choose Beclecor waterproof cotton terry mattress encasement? 1. The mattress cannot be cleaned, but the mattress encasement can! As long as an unprotected accident occurs, your mattress will leave permanent stains or odors. Affect the sleep of you and your family. With 6-sided waterproof protective cover, you no longer worry about accidental liquid leakage accidents!The cotton terry design gives you extra softness. 2. Save Your Money A good zippered mattress protector can help you save money on buying a mattress, reduce damage to the mattress, and keep the mattress in good use.Extend the service life of the mattress. Product Information : Material ：Cotton Terry Color ：White Closure Type ：Durable Thick Zipper Adaptation mattress height ： 9\"Height: for 8\"-10\" Mattress 13\"Height: for 12\"-14\" Mattress Size : Twin , Twin XL , Full , Full XL , Queen , King , California King Applicable Scenarios :Homes with children or the elderly, Nursing Homes, Hospitals, Hotels, Homestays Washing Instructions : Do not bleach Do not bleach Low temperature drying or hang to dry Low temperature drying or hang to dry Do not dry clean Do not dry clean Do not iron Do not iron Choose the gentle mode and avoid scrubbing and twisting hard Choose the gentle mode and avoid scrubbing and twisting hard Please use laundry detergent that does not contain fluorescent or bleaching ingredients Please use laundry detergent that does not contain fluorescent or bleaching ingredients Do not exceed 60 degrees, too high temperature may damage the waterproof membrane Do not exceed 60 degrees, too high temperature may damage the waterproof membrane","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s+l1w5v0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beclecor","source_asin":"B08J7VG1XS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J7VG1XS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J7VG1XS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
