window.products.push({"id":428717,"name":"IncStores 1/2 Inch Thick Diamond Soft Foam Flooring Tiles | High-Density Interlocking Foam Tiles for Rugged Style in Your Home Gym, Playroom, and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8MGLxu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description - Our new Diamond Soft Tiles are the perfect flooring option for the cost conscious consumer. Waterproof and insulating, these interlocking foam tiles will provide any area with added warmth and comfort in two tread plate patterned colors. Easy to install and maintain, these foam tiles are great for basements, light home gyms, and kids play areas just to name a few. Coming with two detachable edge pieces, each foam tile can be turned into a corner, border, or center tile allowing you to create foam floors of different sizes with the ability to change them as often as you desire. Our Diamond Soft Tiles are also very safe and are free of allergens, latex and phthalates. Note:Foam products can be punctured by sharp animal nails, rough use, high heels, and moving furniture. Material – Closed cell EVA foam rubber. Size – 2' x 2' Thickness – 1/2 Inch measured from the top of the pattern to the bottom. Weight – Each tile weighs approximately 1 Lb. Recommended Uses – Soft interlocking foam tiles have been used successfully as pilates mats, exercise mats, kid/child play mats, workout mats, gym mats, personal training mats, fitness, anti-fatigue mats, laundry rooms, and martial arts floor mats, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8MGLxu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IncStores","source_asin":"B00NTCORSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NTCORSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NTCORSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":428718,"name":"Magnolias On Gold Ornate Frame Velvet Cloth by Martin Johnson Heade, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XFw2y2CCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped multi panel canvas art set features decorative tiles with Mayan designs. Most days, one would find Marion Rose putting on her favorite music or playing an old video before settling in to paint for the day in her spacious studio, especially once the winter chill set in. Her work is influenced by past masters such as Joaquin Sorolla, Tom Thomson, Carl Rungius, Bob Kuhn, and many others that work today in a variety of subjects and media. She also studied printmaking, life painting and drawing in college in her 30's. Her subjects come from her life of traveling enthusiastically as often as she could, both close to home or across the ocean. Sketching and studying animals were a favorite pastime, setting an excellent foundation for creating authentic work. Texture and richly colored paint applied generously by knife or brush strokes capture the essence of a subject's spirit and demeanor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XFw2y2CCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B074CPV5CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074CPV5CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074CPV5CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
