window.products.push({"id":428870,"name":"Air Fryer Magnetic Cheat Sheet Set, Instant Air Fryer Accessories Cooking Times Chart, Airfryer Instant Vortex Accessory Magnets Frying Quick Referenc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Li4wVGsGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handy Air Fryer Accessories: Each air fryer magnetic cheat sheet set comes with 3 magnet sheets for air fryers that show the Cook Time, Temperature, Size of food and Meal type. The air fryer cooking times chart is printed on magnetic sheets in different colors to make it easy to identify the food item. The air fryer cheat sheet magnets take the guesswork out of cooking, handy kitchen gadgets for your family and loved one. Clear Food Classifications: Our magnet sheets feature 72 common foods including Frozen Foods, Beef, Chicken, Vegetable, etc. The cooking times charts are printed in LARGE font and classified in food panels to make sure you can read them at a glance. The cooking accessories have included cook mode for each food, making it an air fryer cookbook for frying quick reference guide Premium Magnet Material: Our magnetic cheat sheets are made of durable materials with flexible magnets that are long lasting. This waterproof and anti-scratch magnet sheet set is laminated with plastic film in composite layers. The cook time tables are printed on glossy paper with 3D effect and sharp contrast background to make sure you can easily identify the food and cooking time from any angle in a distance. Stick on Any Surface: The air fryer cheat sheets feature a strong magnetic backing that allows you easily stick them to refrigerator or any magnetic surface in your kitchen. For most air fryers with plastic body, use the included FREE adhesive metal plates to make a magnetic surface and stick your cheat sheet magnets. You can also stick the magnet sheets to refrigerator and stack up in layers, easy to stick and easy to remove. Wide Compatibility: We make this airfryer cookbook magnet to be compatible with COSORI Air Fryer, Instant Vortex Air Fryer, Ninja Air Fryer, Ultrean Air Fryer, and any other air fryers, air fryer ovens on the market so that you can save effort on air frying and more time to enjoy healthy delicious meals. For any enquiry, feel free to contact our customer service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Li4wVGsGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everacc","source_asin":"B0C6LF7CZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-428870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6LF7CZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6LF7CZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
